**Reason**: Both vulnerabilities are in the Vulkan hardware acceleration code path (`-hwaccel vulkan`). This system has no Vulkan-capable GPU and no Vulkan ICD present — `ffmpeg -hwaccels` lists no Vulkan backend. Without Vulkan hardware, FFmpeg never enters `set_pps()` regardless of the input file's content, so file-based PoCs cannot trigger either overflow here.
